sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Service as RemotePlanner<br/>src/todo/service/remote_planner.py
    participant Adapter as TodoApi<br/>src/todo/infrastructure/client/todo_api/todo_api.py
    participant Stub as ItemsServiceStub<br/>src/todo/gen/client/todo/todo_pb2_grpc.py
    participant Interceptor as _CallInterceptor<br/>src/todo/infrastructure/client/core/grpcclient/client.py
    participant API as Todo API, or with TODO_API_HOST=mock its emulator<br/>src/todo/infrastructure/client/todo_api/mock/todo_api_mock.py

    Service->>+Adapter: plan_items(titles)
    Adapter->>+Stub: PlanItems(request)
    Stub->>+Interceptor: the call of /todo.v1.ItemsService/PlanItems
    Note over Interceptor: the method is in the adapter's list, the client middleware run around each attempt
    Note over Interceptor: record "grpc client call sent"
    Interceptor->>+API: PlanItems, x-request-id, within TODO_API_TIMEOUT
    API-->>-Interceptor: response, or a status
    Note over Interceptor: record "grpc client call answered"
    Interceptor-->>-Stub: the response, or raises ApiUnavailableError or ApiStatusError
    Stub-->>-Adapter: the generated response, or the outcome
    Adapter-->>-Service: list of todo_api.Item, or the error
    Note over Service: ApiUnavailableError: kind unavailable. Code INVALID_ARGUMENT: kind invalid. Anything else: no kind
